  * Copyright © 2026 Conduit contributors
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
  *
- * GPU time per render pass and per primary command buffer, from GPU
- * timestamps, for finding the passes that make a frame heavy
- * (NVK_PASS_PROFILE=1; off by default).
+ * GPU time per render pass, per run of operations outside render passes and
+ * per primary command buffer, from GPU timestamps, for finding what makes a
+ * frame heavy (NVK_PASS_PROFILE=1; off by default).
  *
  * Each render pass (vkCmdBeginRendering, and render pass objects through the
- * common runtime), each execution of a secondary command buffer
- * (vkCmdExecuteCommands, timed in the primary) and each primary graphics
- * command buffer gets a record
- * slot in a mapped GART ring when it is recorded: a 16-byte report with a
- * timestamp written by the 3D class at its start (pipeline location ALL,
